@title Save changes? at its smallest width (1366): title, text and Save, Don't save, Cancel stay in view
@area Windows
@sizes 1366x768
# Critical hardware finding KC-02: edits were written to the project file, Quit never asked.
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
key q
wait 4
text circuit breaker
wait 6
click_text "Miniature circuit breaker, 3-pole" Button
wait 6
click 450 200
wait 6
key Escape
answer_dialog ~/Documents/KoperCAD/unsaved-edits.kopercad
key ctrl+s
wait 20
expect_file ~/Documents/KoperCAD/unsaved-edits.kopercad 4000
expect "Saved"
key q
wait 4
text contactor
wait 6
click_text "Contactor main contacts, 3-pole" Button
wait 6
click 450 350
wait 6
key Escape
expect_scene K1
expect "Unsaved changes"
shot edited-not-saved
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text close project
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Save changes?"
expect "Don't save"
expect "Save changes?"
shot asks-home
drag 881 372 200 372
wait 10
expect "Save changes?"
expect "Cancel"
shot save-changes-minimum
check_layout
click_text Cancel
wait 10
expect_not "Save changes?"
